                                "sense_id": "935bbae2-b0b7-3656-bdeb-27c27b0d1e8c",
                                "text": "He watched for a while, pacing the small, slippery cobbles, then made for the deep shade of a stone porch on the other side of the square, where a sheet with a red cross on it had been draped around a pillar. A two-wheeled field dispensary with no driver stood outside the building."
